# Ensure Go source files always use LF, regardless of core.autocrlf.
# Without this, the autocrlf=true default on Windows converts LF→CRLF
# on checkout, which breaks `gofmt` and floods CI with whole-file
# "File is not properly formatted" diffs.
*.go text eol=lf

# Golden-frame snapshots are byte-compared by TestGoldenFrames; a CRLF
# checkout on Windows would break every frame test. Wordlists and the
# nmap probe database get the same treatment for reproducibility.
# / golden 帧快照由 TestGoldenFrames 字节级比对，Windows 检出转 CRLF
# 会炸全部帧测试。口令字典与 nmap 探针库同理保持 LF。
*.txt text eol=lf
